WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.430
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.378 --> 00:00:06.920
SPEAKER: Give me
one minute, and I'll

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.560
show you how Chronicle
can detect security

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.510
exploits in your enterprise.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.030
Let's say your
colleague Alex reports

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.700
encountering a suspicious
domain that asked

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.860
for her corporate credentials.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.880
Chronicle allows you to quickly
search your security telemetry

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.530
for the suspicious domain.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:27.620
You can also find out if
other employees or assets

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:29.060
have been compromised.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.659
By stitching correlated data
points into coherent events,

00:00:32.659 --> 00:00:35.180
Chronicle makes sense
of the massive data

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.360
to find vulnerabilities
like phishing, malware,

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:41.360
and more sophisticated
patterns of attack.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:44.270
Even if the phishing attack
was unnoticed by Alex,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:47.600
Chronicle may have alerted
you about the exploit.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.630
Chronicle Detect integrates
with Google's own threat

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.550
intelligence, as
well as third-party

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:55.760
feeds, to identify
well-known exploits.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.310
You can also migrate your
existing security rules

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:00.680
from existing tools
to Chronicle's

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:02.660
expressive language.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:06.860
To use Chronicle, simply enable
Chronicle for your GCP project

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:09.890
in the console with
your one-time password.

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:13.760
Once enabled, Chronicle starts
to ingest your security logs

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:15.000
at scale.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.390
So next time you look into
the tech vulnerabilities

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:21.110
across your fleet, take a
minute to explore Chronicle.

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:25.340
To learn more, check out
cloud.google.com/chronicle.

